{"unit_id":"tag:05YX:statement","translation":"在定理<REF_0001>的情形中，<MATH_0001>也确实诱导等价（equivalence），在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>、其中<MATH_0003>仿射（affine），与平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>、其中<MATH_0005>仿射（affine），这两类对象之间。这例如由《极限（Limits）》命题<REF_0002>推出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"Limits","target_term":"极限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"范畴间的等价。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Limits","target_term":"极限","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03SI:statement","translation":"平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology）的拓扑不变性（Topological invariance）<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>为普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism），在概形（schemes）之间（例如由幂零（nilpotent）理想层（sheaf of ideals）定义的闭浸入（closed immersion））。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（sites）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>同构（isomorphic），\n<STRUCT_0003> 平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑斯（topoi）<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>等价（equivalent），且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>，对所有<MATH_0007>及任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0008>，定义于<MATH_0009>上，成立。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零"},{"source_term":"sheaf of ideals","target_term":"理想层"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性","context":"定理标题。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚","context":"任意基变换后为同胚。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零","context":"理想层幂零。"},{"source_term":"sheaf of ideals","target_term":"理想层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","cont