{"unit_id":"tag:03SI:proof","translation":"范畴等价（equivalence of categories）<MATH_0001>由定理<REF_0001>给出。我们省略以下证明：在这个等价（equivalence）下，平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（coverings）相互对应。因此(1)成立。第(2)、(3)项由(1)形式地推出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"范畴等价。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":["原文省略等价下平展覆盖对应的证明；候选忠实保留。"]}
