{"unit_id":"tag:04E1:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在恰当的一般性下陈述并证明命题<REF_0001>之前，我们先简要地对闭浸入（closed immersions）陈述并证明它。具体地，前面的某些论证在闭浸入（closed immersion）的情形相当容易理解，因此这里以简化形式重复这些论证。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n本节余下部分中，<MATH_0001>为闭浸入（closed immersion）。函子（functor）<MATH_0002>将按所示记作<MATH_0003>。由于闭浸入（closed immersion）的性质在任意基变换（base change）下保持，概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>是闭子概形（closed subscheme），位于<MATH_0005>中。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"closed immersions","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"closed immersions","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04FV:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的闭浸入（closed immersion）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes），平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0003>上。设<MATH_0004>为态射（morphism），定义于<MATH_0005>上。则存在图表（diagram）<MATH_0006>，位于<MATH_0007>中，使得<MATH_0008>为同构（isomorphism），且<MATH_0009>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"态射图表。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
